---
---
<section class="bg-paper py-[var(--space-section)]" aria-labelledby="integrations-heading">
  <div class="container-x">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <h2
          id="integrations-heading"
          class="text-[length:var(--text-h2)] font-[800] leading-[var(--text-h2--line-height)] tracking-[-0.01em]"
        >
          Connect your CRM<br class="hidden sm:block" /> and favorite apps
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink-70">
          Heymarket offers built-in integrations with leading business apps and CRMs, including
          <a href="#" class="underline decoration-ink-30 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-ink">Salesforce</a> and HubSpot.
          Leverage existing contact databases and incorporate custom fields in messaging campaigns.
          Automatically create or update contacts and capture their actions in your system of record.
          You can also build your own integrations with Heymarket's powerful
          <a href="#" class="underline decoration-ink-30 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-ink">API</a>.
        </p>
        <a
          href="#"
          class="group mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-bold text-purple underline underline-offset-4"
        >
          See all integrations
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="flex justify-center md:justify-end">
        <img
          src="/heymarket-website/assets/mock-integrations.webp"
          alt="Integration logos including HubSpot, Zendesk, Zapier, Microsoft Teams, Twilio, Slack, Salesforce, and Shopify."
          width="668"
          height="602"
          loading="lazy"
          class="h-auto w-full max-w-[540px]"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
